# Currency rules, Dutch. Same format as the English file (see there).
#
# [currency.symbol]: form | ISO 4217 code | prefix, suffix or both | confidence (optional).
# [currency.name]:   forms, comma-separated | ISO 4217 code | value of one in the currency (optional) | confidence (optional).

[currency.symbol]
$ | USD | both | 0.9
US$ | USD | prefix
A$ | AUD | prefix
C$ | CAD | prefix
CA$ | CAD | prefix
€ | EUR | both
£ | GBP | both
¥ | JPY | both | 0.7
￥ | JPY | both | 0.7
₹ | INR | both
₩ | KRW | both
₽ | RUB | both
₺ | TRY | both
₪ | ILS | both

